  m_text: "\nThe\t\t\t      may be Large, \nbut for now your \t          is small.\n\nThis
    village has been trapped and rampaged by new\n                 that are being
    built along the                  to the \n\nThere are currently                  
    in your area,\n                              to free this village\r\n\n\nDue
    to techinal issues this level is a smaller version of Village 1 mixed with some
    elements of Village 2 shown in the pitch. Just made for playtesting purposes,
    the real levels will be much better and bigger inplementing the stuff \ndecussed
    in the week 5 pitch."
